# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — NEVER COMMIT. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
# Real values live only in gitignored files + an off-box vault (rules.md R21).
# Only *.example templates are tracked. If in doubt, do not commit it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Env files (keep the .example templates)
.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Recyclarr secrets
**/secrets.yml
!**/secrets.yml.example

# Alertmanager Discord webhook
configs/pi/alertmanager/discord-webhook-url
!configs/pi/alertmanager/discord-webhook-url.example

# AdGuard config — holds the admin password hash (rules.md F3)
**/AdGuardHome.yaml

# PBS datastore encryption key / rclone remote config / offsite crypt
**/rclone.conf
*.enc
*.age

# Keys & certs
*.key
*.pem
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub

# Broad catch-alls (false-ignores are safer than false-commits on a public repo)
*secret*
*credential*
!*.example

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
